OL,3,GNEWSACommunity garden's food supply hit
OL,4,Aby dry summer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Unfortunately, I'm not sure we'll get
OL,7,Fto a tonne this year - and that's real
OL,8,Ffresh food that normally supports our
OL,9,Fcommunity which is now not going to be
OL,10,Favailable."
